  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ONEA - Project Noumoudara - D&#xe9;dougou 2024-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to sustainable and equitable improvement of access to drinking water through the multi-locality system of Noumoudara in the Haut-Bassins region, and the strengthening of the drinking water supply network of D&#xe9;dougou to take into account the Internally Displaced Persons (IDPs) in the Boucle du Mouhoun region (Burkina Faso)

- 40,000 new people will be served adequately and sustainably through the multi-locality AEP system of Noumoudara, by 2025;

- 9,000 both Internally Displaced Populations and host populations will be served through the creation of more than 1,000 Private Connections (BP) and 15 Standpipes (BF).</narrative>
  </description>
